      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Camp_Springs%2C_Maryland"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Camp Springs sits at 38°48′27″N 76°55′05″W, placing it just south of the Capital Beltway and close to Fort Meade.",
